A lazy line keeps a description in a div in an item

```
- :::
  :: t
  : t
  x
    # u
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
        <dd>
          <p>t
x</p>
          <h1 id="u">u</h1>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

````
1. ::: note
   :: t
   : t
   x
     ```
     k
     ```
.
<ol>
  <li>
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
        <dd>
          <p>t
x</p>
          <pre><code>k
</code></pre>
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </li>
</ol>
````
